  "label": "Fixed-gear bicycle as a metaphor for an animal",
  "description": "The meme uses the bicycle as a visual pun. The 'first one' (the bicycle) is being compared to the 'second one' (the Black men) in the photograph. The joke implies that the bicycle, like the Black men, 'can't sing' when chains are put on it. This is a racist metaphor that equates the bicycle with a Black person, reinforcing the dehumanizing stereotype.",
